# WFORMTF.KEY - read-only fields take the focus and never change, typing
# included; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTF.SNP.
# ID is FF_RO and SERIAL FF_NEWONLY: read-only in FORM_EDIT.
K F5
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
S ID
T abc
S IDTYPED
K BS DEL INS ALT-BS HOME END
S IDKEYS
K TAB
S SERIAL
T xyz
K BS DEL INS ALT-BS HOME
S SERKEYS
# Nothing changed, so Esc leaves without asking.
K ESC
S EDITEND
# FORM_NEW: SERIAL can be changed (and is folded to upper case), ID not.
K F7
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T q
S NEWID
K TAB
T abc1
S NEWSER
K ESC
S ASK
K Y
S NEWEND
# CTRL-INS copies a read-only field's selection, which SHIFT-INS does not
# paste back over it: ID's R-1 pastes into Text.
K F5
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
K HOME SHIFT-END CTRL-INS SHIFT-INS
S IDCOPY
K STAB STAB STAB STAB STAB STAB STAB STAB
K HOME SHIFT-END SHIFT-INS
S IDPASTE
K ESC
S ASK2
K Y
